            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f3" n="2" xml:id="d145-f3-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d122-f9">footnote 8, Document 122</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f4" n="3" xml:id="d145-f4-content">
                <p>Macmillan was scheduled to visit the Soviet
                    Union February 21–March 3.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
